X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_314482066@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260516T035253Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260523T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260523T170000
SUMMARY:Casual Volleyball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nWe're a g
 roup of people who will start by hitting the ball around for the first 20-
 30 minutes and then will break up into 2-4 teams for two or three hours of
  play.\n\nIf we have more than 20 people show up\, we'll break up into thr
 ee or four teams of 6 (Some may have 7\, 8 or 9. Additional players just r
 otate into play). Games will be to 10 points. Rally scoring. Winner stays 
 on (unless a team has won four straight).\n\nWe'll be heading outdoors to 
 the hard court in Leonia off Overpeck County Pk Driveway in the Overpeck C
 ounty Park.\n\n\\*\\*\\* After playing\, we'll be likely heading to Tropic
 al Juice Bar\, an idea of regular attendee Kate\, for a drink and snack. I
 t's located at 60 River St. in Hackensack. Feel free to join us or suggest
  another spot for a post-volleyball hangout. \\*\\*\\*\n\nThere's no fee t
 o play volleyball and nothing else you need to do besides show up. Come an
 ytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are not here to analy
 ze your form. We're more for people who haven't played in months\, maybe y
 ears\, and just want to occasionally play again and hang out.\n\nDirection
 s: You can Google "Volleyball Court in Leonia" and it should come up. Or t
 ype 41 Willow Tree Road\, Leonia\, NJ 07605 into your GPS\, but note that 
 it's not on Willow Tree Road\, just near it. Instead\, turn onto Overpeck 
 County Pk Driveway off Fort Lee Road (Degraw Avenue). It is past the tenni
 s courts and near a basketball court and track. You can try Googling Leoni
 a High School as well. That should help you find it.\n\nWe don't have the 
 court reserved and if it happens to be taken\, we may play with those alre
 ady occupying it or we will try to relocate on the fly. It's certainly pos
 sible that we may have to cancel that day if we can't find a suitable spot
 . Please keep that in mind. And if it's looking like it'll rain or snow\, 
 I'll make a call on whether to cancel around an hour ahead of time.\n\nPle
 ase bring a ball and net if you have them for possible use during the game
 . Feel free to bring a speaker for music\, or snacks and drinks for consum
 ption during play.\n\nIf you have trouble finding the court or group\, you
  can call or text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609. There is plenty of parking 
 and an open bathroom at the park.\n\nHope you'll join us for our 19th "off
 icial" volleyball event. Questions or comments? You can message Andy on Me
 etup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609. Check out bowling\, soccer\, voll
 eyball\, tennis or one of our other activities at: www.meetup.com/north-je
 rsey-bowling-soccer-volleyball\n\nIf interested in staying touch with grou
 p members or conversing about future events\, feel free to inquire about o
 ur WhatsApp group chat.
